    "about": {
        "title": "Budgeting Made Simple",
        "description": "Budgenix empowers individuals and households to take control of their finances with intuitive tools for tracking expenses, setting goals, and managing budgets effortlessly.",
        "paragraph1": "Budgenix is built for real people who want a clear view of their personal finances. Whether you're saving for a dream vacation or simply want to know where your money goes each month, Budgenix makes it easy to stay on track.",
        "paragraph2": "Our platform simplifies the budgeting process with smart categories, recurring expense tracking, and insightful analytics—so you can make confident financial decisions every day.",
        "paragraph3": "With Budgenix, you can set up budgets in minutes, track your spending across multiple accounts, and visualize your progress toward your financial goals. We prioritize simplicity and transparency, ensuring you always know where you stand.",
        "paragraph4": "Whether you're budgeting solo or managing shared expenses with your household, Budgenix gives you the tools to collaborate, save smarter, and achieve your goals faster.",
