        "missionDescription": "Budgenix is dedicated to helping people achieve financial clarity and freedom. Our core values guide everything we do.",
        "values": {
        "transparency": {
            "title": "Be Transparent.",
            "desc": "We believe in clarity—no hidden fees, no surprises. Your financial data is yours, always."
